    "text": "ijpr.org\nwebsite\nAshland\nLightning sparks 72 wildfires across Southern Oregon\nBy Oregon Public Broadcasting,\n1 days agoOne of those, the Neil Creek Fire just south of Ashland, has sparked Level 2 (Be Set) evacuation orders in the area and closed one lane of southbound Interstate 5 from milepost 10.5-8.5. The fire was estimated to have grown to 124 acres by Wednesday afternoon. Additional personnel and resources...\n14",
